      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T16:45:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From the man page\n```\n--porcelain[\u003d\u003cversion\u003e]\nGive the output in an easy-to-parse format for scripts. This is similar to the short output, but will remain stable across Git versions and regardless of user configuration. See below for details.\n```\n\nCurious what negative affects porcelain has?",
      "parentUuid": "754b148d_d71ef6d9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 80,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 80,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "5d898eb922d6572f1b71400648bd02f6783eef07",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
