      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T16:45:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The static version just replaces the build time with `STATIC` (See point 4 in go/cros-fwid-deprecation). IIRC it was implemented because:\n- The option already exited in zmake\n- It helps recreate reproducible builds",
      "parentUuid": "602ea8de_9d71e20f",
