      "side": 1,
      "message": "`official_build` implies `static` but `static` doesn\u0027t implies `official_build`.\n\n`static` generates something like `skyrim-0.0.0-STATIC-1234abc`. The difference is the commit hash. Is the hash useful? I think the answer is no. I will merge them if no one objects.",
